BLOCK 23 {"kind": "p", "text": "The official head and neck tumor dataset consists of 150 cases. For this study, we selected Task 1 and exclusively used pre-RT data for training. The dataset was randomly split, with 30 cases designated as the internal validation set, while the remaining 120 cases were used for model training."}
BLOCK 24 {"kind": "p", "text": "The experiments were implemented using Python and the PyTorch deep learning library. Training was conducted on a GPU Server. The training protocols are presented in Table 1 . The hardware configuration and development environments are presented in Table 2 ."}
